'''Ānism''', also known as '''Āni'''<!--Old English for One--> or the '''One Faith''', is a [[wikipedia:monotheism|monotheistic]] religion. 

Ānism developed from the spiritual teachings of [[DUDE]]. 

==Beliefs==
===Image of God===
The "image of God" is a foundational aspect of Ānist belief with regard to the fundamental understanding of mankind's nature. It was first mentioned in the [[BOOK]], which reads: "Tall and lean compared to his other creations, God created man in his own image; male and female he created them."

The [[One Orthodox Church]] argues that it refers to [[Mankind]] as a whole but the [[One Church of Man]] believes bla bla bla.

